:9,"updatedAt":9,"event_categories":10,"image":30},null,"營養讀書會：《中國居民膳食營養素參考攝入量DRIs 2023年版》","\u003Cp\u003E📗營養讀書會：《中國居民膳食營養素參考攝入量DRIs 2023年版》\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E由中國營養學會牽頭、雲集中國疾病預防控制中心、國家食品安全風險評估中心、北京協和醫院等多家醫院，以及北京大學等多家大學的代表組成的專家組，歷時3年編著的 ✨權威營養指南⚡，助你不但吃飽吃得安全，更加 吃出健康‼️\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E⭐ DRIs核心解讀：不同年齡、性別、生理期的營養需求\u003Cbr\u003E⭐ 避雷指引：透視常見誤區，告別無效補充\u003Cbr\u003E⭐ 知行合一：善用DRIs調理飲食，逆轉慢性病患兼逆齡\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：2025年5月12日起逢星期一\u003Cbr\u003E時間：晚上8:30-9:30\u003Cbr\u003E形式：Zoom線上直播\u003Cbr\u003E費用：全免\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E❤️ 每周一小時高效學習，量身訂造你一生專屬的營養地圖❤️\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","DRIs","2025-12-23T03:58:33.701Z",{"data":11},[12,18,24],{"id":13,"attributes":14},6,{"name":15,"slug":16,"description":5,"createdAt":17,"updatedAt":17},"活學營養","nutrition","2023-02-12T02:38:55.947Z",{"id":19,"attributes":20},1,{"name":21,"slug":22,"description":5,"createdAt":23,"updatedAt":23},"讀書會","book-sharing","2023-02-12T02:38:55.939Z",{"id":25,"attributes":26},8,{"name":27,"slug":28,"description":5,"createdAt":29,"updatedAt":29},"每周恆常活動","weekly_activity","2025-12-23T03:48:29.472Z",{"data":31},{"id":32,"attributes":33},88,{"name":34,"alternativeText":5,"caption":5,"width":35,"height":36,"formats":37,"hash":68,"ext":39,"mime":42,"size":69,"url":70,"previewUrl":5,"provider":71,"provider_metadata":5,"createdAt":72,"updatedAt":72},"ee41f0bc-60bc-403c-92cb-487c181f9885.JPG",1131,1600,{"large":38,"small":47,"medium":54,"thumbnail":61},{"ext":39,"url":40,"hash":41,"mime":42,"name":43,"path":5,"size":44,"width":45,"height":46},".JPG","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07.JPG","large_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07","image\u002Fjpeg","large_ee41f0bc-60bc-403c-92cb-487c181f9885.JPG",100.83,707,1000,{"ext":39,"url":48,"hash":49,"mime":42,"name":50,"path":5,"size":51,"width":52,"height":53},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07.JPG","small_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07","small_ee41f0bc-60bc-403c-92cb-487c181f9885.JPG",35.03,353,500,{"ext":39,"url":55,"hash":56,"mime":42,"name":57,"path":5,"size":58,"width":59,"height":60},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07.JPG","medium_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07","medium_ee41f0bc-60bc-403c-92cb-487c181f9885.JPG",66.31,530,750,{"ext":39,"url":62,"hash":63,"mime":42,"name":64,"path":5,"size":65,"width":66,"height":67},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07.JPG","thumbnail_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07","thumbnail_ee41f0bc-60bc-403c-92cb-487c181f9885.JPG",5.46,110,156,"ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07",197.05,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07.JPG","aws-s3","2025-12-23T03:57:44.573Z",{"id":74,"attributes":75},205,{"start_date":76,"title":77,"content":78,"excerpt":79,"slug":80,"end_date":76,"tags":5,"createdAt":81,"updatedAt":81,"event_categories":82,"image":86},"2025-09-20","與菌同行","\u003Cp\u003E《食材探源 × 手作烹飪 × 營養科學》系列&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E動手連結食物，發掘食物中的營養力量！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E活動頭炮：與菌同行\u003Cbr\u003E⭐️ 手作零酵母小圓餅：體驗徒手搓揉麵團的樂趣，感受食物的原始力量\u003Cbr\u003E⭐️ 探索「菌」世界：認識日常接觸的微生物，了解它們與健康的密切關聯。&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E⭐️ 健康全面升級：從增強身體好菌開始，提升腸道健康、免疫系統、情緒商數、認知功能，由內而外煥發健康光彩！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：9月20日（六）\u003Cbr\u003E時間：上午11:00至13:00\u003Cbr\u003E地點：油麻地登打士街家樂坊15樓廚藝教室\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$120\u002F位 &nbsp;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E小朋友也可以一起體驗徒手揉搓麵團🥳歡迎垂詢\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","《食材探源 × 手作烹飪 × 營養科學》系列 ","food-good-bacteria","2025-09-14T07:35:34.424Z",{"dat